<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.1.6">
<l>kaṇṇā nāṉmuka ṉaippaṭait tāṉē</l>
<l rend="indent">kāra ṇākari yāyaṭi yēṉnāṉ</l>
<l>uṇṇā nāḷpaci yāvatoṉ ṟillai</l>
<l rend="indent">ōvā tēnamō nāraṇā veṉṟu</l>
<l>eṇṇā nāḷumi rukkecuc cāma</l>
<l rend="indent">vēta nāṇmalar koṇṭaṉa pātam</l>
<l>naṇṇā nāḷavai tattuṟu mākil</l>
<l rend="indent">aṉṟe ṉakkavai paṭṭiṉi nāḷē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Kṛṣṇa! You who created the four-faced [Brahmā]!</l>
<l rend="indent">Source! Dark One!</l>
<l>On a day without eating, I, your servant, [feel] no hunger,</l>
<l rend="indent">ceaselessly saying “Namō Nāraṇā”,</l>
<l>[but] on days when [I] do not contemplate the</l>
<l rend="indent">Ṛg, Yajur, and Sāma Vedas,</l>
<l rend="indent">on days when [I] do not approach your feet with fresh flowers,</l>
<l rend="indent">even if [I] have been afflicted,</l>
<l>those days are fasting days for me.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
